			"props": {},
			"text": [
				{
					"insert": "Launched asynchronously by the run scheduler loop once all workers are idle (resolver enabled, no epoch running, not draining), in concurrent batches under a concurrency cap with path-disjoint locking so only non-overlapping conflict items run together. Open resolver runs are a boundary condition that blocks the next epoch."
				}
